`SOC Lab Detection Rule`
`Rule Name: Windows Failed Logon Raw Review`
`Event ID: 4625 (An account failed to log on)`
`MITRE ATT&CK: T1110 (Brute Force)`
`Severity: Low / Informational (Single occurrence)`
`Data Source: WinEventLog:Security | index=blue`
`Description: Returns raw failed authentication attempts with logon type, status codes, and user details.`
